Tell the embedder which characters need a fallback font.

The engine bundles some fonts lazily (CJK). FontCache asks for a system
fallback font when no font in the cascade has a character; the embedder now
hears about that character, loads a font that covers it if it has one, and
invalidates the font caches so the text is shaped again.

